CHAPTER.VERS:
Hear you

          {+}
         this, O house of Jacob, who are called by the name of Israel, and have come forth out of the waters of Judah; who swear by the name of Yahweh, and make mention of the God of Israel, but not in truth, nor in righteousness

You have heard it; look at all this; and you

          {+}
        , will you

          {+}
         not declare it? I have shown you new things from this time, even hidden things, which you haven't known.

Assemble yourselves, all you

          {+}
        , and hear; who among them has declared these things? He whom Yahweh loves will perform his pleasure on Babylon, and his arm [will be on] the Chaldeans.

Come

          {+}
         near to me, hear

          {+}
         this; from the beginning I have not spoken in secret; from the time that it was, there I am: and now the Sovereign Yahweh has sent me, and his Spirit.

Go

          {+}
         forth from Babylon, flee

          {+}
         from the Chaldeans; with a voice of singing declare

          {+}
        , tell this, utter it even to the end of the earth: say

          {+}
        , Yahweh has redeemed his slave Jacob.
